# text = Reed , I presume , from after-occurrences , that the apothecary ventured to recommend my being sent to school ; and the recommendation was no doubt readily enough adopted ; for as Abbot said , in discussing the subject with Bessie when both sat sewing in the nursery one night , after I was in bed , and , as they thought , asleep Abbot , I think , gave me credit for being a sort of infantine Guy Fawkes .
