# text = Bessie , when she heard this narrative , sighed and said responded Abbot agreed Bessie cried the fervent Abbot They went From my discourse with Mr . Lloyd , and from the above reported conference between Bessie and Abbot , I gathered enough of hope to suffice as a motive for wishing to get well : a change seemed near , -- I desired and waited it in silence .
