# text = Reed occupied her usual seat by the fireside ; she made a signal to me to approach ; I did so , and she introduced me to the stony stranger with the words HE , for it was a man , turned his head slowly towards where I stood , and having examined me with the two inquisitive-looking grey eyes which twinkled under a pair of bushy brows , said solemnly , and in a bass voice was the doubtful answer ; and he prolonged his scrutiny for some minutes .
