# text = Now , uttered before a stranger , the accusation cut me to the heart ; I dimly perceived that she was already obliterating hope from the new phase of existence which she destined me to enter ; I felt , though I could not have expressed the feeling , that she was sowing aversion and unkindness along my future path ; I saw myself transformed under Mr . Brocklehurst's eye into an artful , noxious child , and what could I do to remedy the injury thought I , as I struggled to repress a sob , and hastily wiped away some tears , the impotent evidences of my anguish said Mr .
