# text = Seen now , in broad daylight , she looked tall , fair , and shapely ; brown eyes with a benignant light in their iris , and a fine pencilling of long lashes round , relieved the whiteness of her large front ; on each of her temples her hair , of a very dark brown , was clustered in round curls , according to the fashion of those times , when neither smooth bands nor long ringlets were in vogue ; her dress , also in the mode of the day , was of purple cloth , relieved by a sort of Spanish trimming of black velvet ; a gold watch ( watches were not so common then as now ) shone at her girdle .
