# text = I kept expecting that Miss Scatcherd would praise her attention ; but , instead of that , she suddenly cried out Burns made no answer : I wondered at her silence thought I My attention was now called off by Miss Smith desiring me to hold a skein of thread : while she was winding it , she talked to me from time to time , asking whether I had ever been at school before , whether I could mark , stitch , knit , & amp ; c .; till she dismissed me , I could not pursue my observations on Miss Scatcherd's movements .
