# text = These words fell like the knell of doom Miss Temple seemed to remonstrate he pursued , " I have a Master to serve whose kingdom is not of this world : my mission is to mortify in these girls the lusts of the flesh ; to teach them to clothe themselves with shame-facedness and sobriety , not with braided hair and costly apparel ; and each of the young persons before us has a string of hair twisted in plaits which vanity itself might have woven ; these , I repeat , must be cut off ; think of the time wasted , of -- " Mr . Brocklehurst was here interrupted : three other visitors , ladies , now entered the room .
