# text = Of course they did ; for I felt their eyes directed like burning-glasses against my scorched skin A pause -- in which I began to steady the palsy of my nerves , and to feel that the Rubicon was passed ; and that the trial , no longer to be shirked , must be firmly sustained pursued the black marble clergyman , with pathos Now came a pause of ten minutes , during which I , by this time in perfect possession of my wits , observed all the female Brocklehursts produce their pocket-handkerchiefs and apply them to their optics , while the elderly lady swayed herself to and fro , and the two younger ones whispered Mr . Brocklehurst resumed With this sublime conclusion , Mr . Brocklehurst adjusted the top button of his surtout , muttered something to his family , who rose , bowed to Miss Temple , and then all the great people sailed in state from the room .
