# text = She had scarcely finished ere the bell announced bedtime ! no delay could be admitted ; Miss Temple embraced us both , saying , as she drew us to her heart Helen she held a little longer than me : she let her go more reluctantly ; it was Helen her eye followed to the door ; it was for her she a second time breathed a sad sigh ; for her she wiped a tear from her cheek .
