# text = That night , on going to bed , I forgot to prepare in imagination the Barmecide supper of hot roast potatoes , or white bread and new milk , with which I was wont to amuse my inward cravings : I feasted instead on the spectacle of ideal drawings , which I saw in the dark ; all the work of my own hands : freely pencilled houses and trees , picturesque rocks and ruins , Cuyp-like groups of cattle , sweet paintings of butterflies hovering over unblown roses , of birds picking at ripe cherries , of wren's nests enclosing pearl-like eggs , wreathed about with young ivy sprays .
