# text = And now vegetation matured with vigour ; Lowood shook loose its tresses ; it became all green , all flowery ; its great elm , ash , and oak skeletons were restored to majestic life ; woodland plants sprang up profusely in its recesses ; unnumbered varieties of moss filled its hollows , and it made a strange ground-sunshine out of the wealth of its wild primrose plants : I have seen their pale gold gleam in overshadowed spots like scatterings of the sweetest lustre .
