# text = Mr . Nasmyth , came between me and Miss Temple : I saw her in her travelling dress step into a post-chaise , shortly after the marriage ceremony ; I watched the chaise mount the hill and disappear beyond its brow ; and then retired to my own room , and there spent in solitude the greatest part of the half-holiday granted in honour of the occasion .
