# text = Miss Gryce snored at last ; she was a heavy Welshwoman , and till now her habitual nasal strains had never been regarded by me in any other light than as a nuisance ; to-night I hailed the first deep notes with satisfaction ; I was debarrassed of interruption ; my half-effaced thought instantly revived I soliloquised ( mentally , be it understood ; I did not talk aloud I sat up in bed by way of arousing this said brain : it was a chilly night ; I covered my shoulders with a shawl , and then I proceeded TO THINK again with all my might I could not tell : nothing answered me ; I then ordered my brain to find a response , and quickly .
