# text = He vanished , but reappeared instantly I jumped up , took my muff and umbrella , and hastened into the inn - passage : a man was standing by the open door , and in the lamp-lit street I dimly saw a one-horse conveyance said the man rather abruptly when he saw me , pointing to my trunk in the passage He hoisted it on to the vehicle , which was a sort of car , and then I got in ; before he shut me up , I asked him how far it was to Thornfield
