# text = I felt rather confused at being the object of more attention than I had ever before received , and , that too , shown by my employer and superior ; but as she did not herself seem to consider she was doing anything out of her place , I thought it better to take her civilities quietly I asked , when I had partaken of what she offered me returned the good lady , approaching her ear to my mouth .
