# text = He said this as if he spoke to a vision , viewless to any eye but his own ; then , folding his arms , which he had half extended , on his chest , he seemed to enclose in their embrace the invisible being he continued , again addressing me I said , as I rose , deeming it useless to continue a discourse which was all darkness to me ; and , besides , sensible that the character of my interlocutor was beyond my penetration ; at least , beyond its present reach ; and feeling the uncertainty , the vague sense of insecurity , which accompanies a conviction of ignorance Ere long , Adele's little foot was heard tripping across the hall .
