# text = Most true is it that My master's colourless , olive face , square , massive brow , broad and jetty eyebrows , deep eyes , strong features , firm , grim mouth , -- all energy , decision , will , -- were not beautiful , according to rule ; but they were more than beautiful to me ; they were full of an interest , an influence that quite mastered me , -- that took my feelings from my own power and fettered them in his .
