# text = She appeared to be on her high horse to-night ; both her words and her air seemed intended to excite not only the admiration , but the amazement of her auditors : she was evidently bent on striking them as something very dashing and daring indeed exclaimed she , rattling away at the instrument she continued after a pause which none interrupted was the response commanded the lady said she , and again touching the piano , she commenced an accompaniment in spirited style thought I : but the tones that then severed the air arrested me .
