# text = But as matters really stood , to watch Miss Ingram's efforts at fascinating Mr . Rochester , to witness their repeated failure -- herself unconscious that they did fail ; vainly fancying that each shaft launched hit the mark , and infatuatedly pluming herself on success , when her pride and self-complacency repelled further and further what she wished to allure -- to witness THIS , was to be at once under ceaseless excitation and ruthless restraint .
