# text = And as for the vague something -- was it a sinister or a sorrowful , a designing or a desponding expression ? -- that opened upon a careful observer , now and then , in his eye , and closed again before one could fathom the strange depth partially disclosed ; that something which used to make me fear and shrink , as if I had been wandering amongst volcanic-looking hills , and had suddenly felt the ground quiver and seen it gape : that something , I , at intervals , beheld still ; and with throbbing heart , but not with palsied nerves .
