# text = The fact was , I had other things to think about ; within the last few months feelings had been stirred in me so much more potent than any they could raise -- pains and pleasures so much more acute and exquisite had been excited than any it was in their power to inflict or bestow -- that their airs gave me no concern either for good or bad I asked soon , looking calmly at Georgiana , who thought fit to bridle at the direct address , as if it were an unexpected liberty said I Georgiana almost started , and she opened her blue eyes wild and wide I added remarked Eliza .
