# text = I asked if Georgiana would accompany her Georgiana , when not unburdening her heart to me , spent most of her time in lying on the sofa , fretting about the dulness of the house , and wishing over and over again that her aunt Gibson would send her an invitation up to town she said I did not ask what she meant by but I suppose she referred to the expected decease of her mother and the gloomy sequel of funeral rites .
