# text = I was still listening in thought to her well-remembered tones -- still picturing her pale and spiritual aspect , her wasted face and sublime gaze , as she lay on her placid deathbed , and whispered her longing to be restored to her divine Father's bosom -- when a feeble voice murmured from the couch behind I knew Mrs .
