# text = I went up to her was her answer looking at me with surprise and a sort of alarm , but still not wildly she repeated I said nothing : I was afraid of occasioning some shock by declaring my identity said she I now gently assured her that I was the person she supposed and desired me to be : and seeing that I was understood , and that her senses were quite collected , I explained how Bessie had sent her husband to fetch me from Thornfield she said ere long I assured her we were alone .
