# text = But I have a veil -- it is down : I may make shift yet to behave with decent composure he added , when he had paused an instant I knew there would be pleasure in meeting my master again , even though broken by the fear that he was so soon to cease to be my master , and by the knowledge that I was nothing to him : but there was ever in Mr . Rochester ( so at least I thought ) such a wealth of the power of communicating happiness , that to taste but of the crumbs he scattered to stray and stranger birds like me , was to feast genially .
