# text = He said I was a capricious witch , and that he would rather sing another time ; but I averred that no time was like the present he asked I was not fond of pampering that susceptible vanity of his ; but for once , and from motives of expediency , I would e'en soothe and stimulate it I did try , but was presently swept off the stool and denominated Being pushed unceremoniously to one side -- which was precisely what I wished -- he usurped my place , and proceeded to accompany himself : for he could play as well as sing .
