# text = I shut the closet to conceal the strange , wraith-like apparel it contained ; which , at this evening hour -- nine o'clock -- gave out certainly a most ghostly shimmer through the shadow of my apartment I said It was not only the hurry of preparation that made me feverish ; not only the anticipation of the great change -- the new life which was to commence to-morrow : both these circumstances had their share , doubtless , in producing that restless , excited mood which hurried me forth at this late hour into the darkening grounds : but a third cause influenced my mind more than they .
