# text = More restless than ever , when I had completed these arrangements I could not sit still , nor even remain in the house : a little time-piece in the room and the old clock in the hall simultaneously struck ten I said The wind roared high in the great trees which embowered the gates ; but the road as far as I could see , to the right hand and the left , was all still and solitary : save for the shadows of clouds crossing it at intervals as the moon looked out , it was but a long pale line , unvaried by one moving speck .
