# text = One idea only still throbbed life-like within me -- a remembrance of God : it begot an unuttered prayer : these words went wandering up and down in my rayless mind , as something that should be whispered , but no energy was found to express them It was near : and as I had lifted no petition to Heaven to avert it -- as I had neither joined my hands , nor bent my knees , nor moved my lips -- it came : in full heavy swing the torrent poured over me .
